{"ticker":{"symbol":"215600.KQ","name":"신라젠","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":1896.0,"change_pct":-0.005246589716684125,"market_cap":262697566208.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":1780.0,"week52_high":5400.0,"sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Biotechnology","country":"South Korea","city":"Seoul","employees":49,"website":"https://www.sillajen.com","business_summary":"SillaJen, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, engages in developing technologies and products using genetic engineering in South Korea. Its clinical pipeline includes Pexa-Vec, which is in phase 2 clinical trial to treat renal cell carcinoma and prostate cancer, as well as in phase 1 clinical trial to treat melanoma and solid tumors. The company also develops BAL0891, which is in phase 1 clinical trial for the treatment of solid tumors; and SJ-600 Series and JX-970 to treat solid tumors and is in preclinical trial. In addition, it operates in biotechnology research industry. SillaJen, Inc. was founded in 2006 and is headquartered in Seoul, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"신라젠(SillaJen, Inc.)은 자회사들과 함께 한국에서 유전공학을 활용한 기술 및 제품 개발에 참여하고 있습니다. 임상 파이프라인에는 신장세포암종 및 전립선암 치료를 위한 임상 2상 시험과 흑색종 및 고형 종양 치료를 위한 임상 1상 시험을 진행 중인 펙사벡(Pexa-Vec)이 포함됩니다. 회사는 또한 고형 종양 치료를 위한 임상 1상 시험 중인 BAL0891을 개발하고 있습니다. SJ-600 시리즈, JX-970 등 고형암 치료제로 전임상 시험 중이다. 또한 생명공학 연구 산업에서도 활동하고 있습니다. SillaJen, Inc.는 2006년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 서울에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"바이오","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":5013362990.0,"operating_income":-24476203010.0,"net_income":-24593128290.0,"eps":-217.067967},{"period":"2023","revenue":3939558690.0,"operating_income":-21345852310.0,"net_income":-20369238690.0,"eps":-179.830366},{"period":"2024","revenue":3926654280.0,"operating_income":-28057612720.0,"net_income":-265257455